  <item>
    <title>035. 如何度过专业瓶颈期？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e71e338d5665c0089bbdbb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e71e338d5665c0089bbdbb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Mar 2024 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>总结一下：</span></p><span></span><p><span>在专业训练的每个阶段难免都会出现瓶颈期，这期节目当中我们俩就从之前自己当学生的角度、到现在我们当老师的角度、以及Jason作为现在还在industry工作演员的角度来讨论，当你每个阶段出现瓶颈期了该怎么度过？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="246">04:06</a> 接受这个现状，每个人都有瓶颈期&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 专业瓶颈期产生的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a> 你对专业老师的信任以及“prejudgment”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 瓶颈期的时候可以用不同的角度和视角去重新审视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> Selftape自我觉察法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 山外有山人外有人&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2636">43:56</a> 不要灰心，但要虚心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a> 真努力和假努力，“黄金49分隐藏任务”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3310">55:10</a> 现场面试的气场 </span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luQxnZ6C5c-aAXqhTiqIOS5fJfaI.m4a" length="85577757" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZwcVhzM3lpc1hnd0h0QUZqZk9VcGhjeS0wWjEucG5n.png"/>
